+### Transferring a user to another organization
+
+`POST /orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}/transfer` with `{"toOrgId":"globex"}` moves a
+user (for example between group companies).
+
+- Only org admins of the organization in the path may transfer. Another
+  organization in the path → 404; a member who is not an org admin → 403.
+- The user must belong to the organization in the path → otherwise 404.
+- `toOrgId` must be an existing organization (`orgs` table) and different from
+  the user's current one → otherwise 400.
+- On success the user's org-admin flag is cleared (it is not carried over).
+  Their memberships in projects outside the target organization are removed,
+  and tasks they were assigned to in those projects are unassigned. Everything
+  happens in one transaction.
+
